# Node: equal.ByBuiltinRule.HomogeneousCartesianEqualsFiniteSequence
# Before: this constructor equality failed proof search.
# cart_n(R,3)=cart(R,R,R)
# Now: a flat product of k copies of S is finite_seq(S,k), also written cart_n(S,k).
